'''Charred Twitchers''' are hostile enemies found in the [[Ashlands]]. These guys are always twitching, as their name suggests. 

There is an alternate summoned version, with only 50 health, invoked by [[Charred Warlock|Warlocks]], see [[Summoned Twitcher]].

== Drops ==
{{CreatureDrops}}
Notably, Charred Twitchers have no trophy.

